WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.667
GitHub is not just where code lives.

2
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:14.000
That's like saying Google Docs is just a place to store documents.

3
00:00:19.333 --> 00:00:24.667
GitHub's real purpose is collaboration and version control.

4
00:00:24.833 --> 00:00:30.000
Every commit is a snapshot: what changed, and why.

5
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Branches let each developer work without breaking the original.

6
00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:46.333
A Pull Request proposes changes for the team to review.

7
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:51.667
When approved, it merges into the main codebase.

8
00:00:53.833 --> 00:00:59.333
React, Node, Linux — all built this way, on GitHub.

9
00:00:59.667 --> 00:01:05.000
Your GitHub profile is your developer portfolio. Start building it.

10
00:01:05.333 --> 00:01:08.667
Start building your developer skills at 0xverse Academy.

